      "words": {
        "items": [
          {
            "p": "I did Tally here in 2024 and joined a hardware shop in Sakherbazar as their accounts person two months later. The GST return practice was exactly what the owner wanted.",
            "span": "· Tally with GST"
          },
          {
            "p": "At 58 I thought it was too late. The 10:30 batch is all people my age. I can now pay bills, video call my daughter and fill the pension form myself.",
            "span": "· Basic Computing"
          },
          {
            "p": "Excel pivot tables got me through my office interview. The teacher made us do the same sheet five different ways until it stuck.",
            "span": "· MS Office"
          }
        ]
      },
      "faq": {
        "items": [
          {
            "summary": "I have never touched a computer. Can I join?",
            "a": "Yes. Basic Computing starts from switching the machine on. About a third of our students are complete beginners, many over 50."
          },
          {
            "summary": "Do I need my own laptop?",
            "a": "No. Every student has a computer in class and free practice hours. If you do have a laptop, bring it on Saturdays and we will set it up the same way."
          },
          {
            "summary": "Can I pay in instalments?",
            "a": "Two instalments for any course over ₹3,000: half at joining, half after the first month. Cash or UPI. A receipt is given for every payment."
          },
          {
            "summary": "What if I miss classes?",
            "a": "Sit in another slot the same week for the same lesson. If you miss more than a week, we give one free catch-up session."
          },
          {
            "summary": "Is the certificate government recognised?",
            "a": "It is our own certificate with a verifiable ID; it is not a government certificate. For a government one we prepare you for the NIELIT CCC exam, which you sit at a NIELIT centre."
          },
          {
            "summary": "Do you help with jobs?",
            "a": "We do not promise placement. We do fix your resume, run mock interviews for accounts and data entry roles, and pass on openings that local shops and offices send us."
          }
        ]
      }
